msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"(She just tossed a bottle in the ocean... Could that be the person he's "
"here for?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Mom!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Akihiko! Sweetheart, what are you doing here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"This man says he found a letter in a bottle and I think it's the one you "
"tossed into the ocean a long time ago!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Oh... Is that so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Yeah. Here it is. I found it washed up on the shore near my place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Oh my goodness... This is from all the way back then..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"When I read it, I figured it might have been a suicide note. I'm glad to "
"see you're alive and well, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"It was a suicide note, yes, one I wrote ten years ago. I had planned to "
"throw myself into the ocean along with the letter and the bottle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "But before I could take the jump... I felt Akihiko kick inside of me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"It was like Yasuaki was shouting at me from beyond the grave. \"Live, "
"dammit!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Wow..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Ever since that moment..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"Every year, on Akihiko's birthday, I come to this cliff to send Yasu-kun "
"another letter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "So that's why he bought this particular bottle..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Uh-huh. It was for my mom."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"It all makes sense now. We were pretty shocked when we read the letter. "
"Thought we might have to plan a rescue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry about that. You don't have to worry about that. I have my son "
"now, and he's my world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Good to hear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Isn't that right, Akihiko?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Yeah. I'll watch out for you too, Mom."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Take good care of your mother, Akihiko."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Don't worry, I will!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Aww, thank you, sweetheart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "All right, then, I'll stop bothering you and head out on my way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid ""
"Wait... Here, will you take some of these with you? They were Yasu-kun's "
"favorite. I don't think you came here today by chance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Sata Andagi<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "The kids at Morning Glory will love these, thanks. Take care."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

